#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.5.rst:17
msgid ""
"**Database:** Fixed a bug where ``Seeder::call()`` did not pass the "
"database connection to child seeders, causing them to use the default "
"connection instead of the one specified via "
"``Database::seeder('group')``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.5.rst:18
msgid ""
"**HTTP:** Updated the Content Security Policy nonce generation to use "
"base64 encoding instead of hexadecimal, ensuring compatibility with CSP "
"specifications."
msgstr ""

